        &lt;SUBSERVICE qualifier="Hard" id="0x129e3444" active="true" actQual="EcuReset"&gt;
          &lt;CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
            &lt;CFGVARIANTREF ref="0x187705b4"/&gt;
          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;This type identifies a &amp;quot;hard reset&amp;quot; condition which simulates the power-on / start-up sequence typically performed after an ECU has been previously disconnected from its power supply (i.e. battery).
This implies that memory (volatile and non-volatile) as well as electronic sub-components directly connected to the ECU (e.g. smart sensors or LIN-components) are initialized upon request of this reset type which are also initialized during the power-up sequence.&lt;/DESC&gt;
