          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;This service is used to indicate to an ECU or a group of ECUâ€™s that an external test tool is still connected to the vehicle and that certain diagnostic services and/or communication that have been previously activated are to remain active.&lt;/DESC&gt;
          &lt;ATTRIBUTE name="PacketHandlerSupport" value="None"/&gt;
          &lt;ATTRIBUTE name="MainHandlerSupport" value="Oem"/&gt;
