        &lt;SUBSERVICE qualifier="Flash_Download_Upload" id="0x187cb154" active="true" actQual="RequestTransferExit"&gt;
          &lt;CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
            &lt;CFGVARIANTREF ref="0x187705b4"/&gt;
          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;The Request Upload service is used by the external test tool to initiate a data transfer from the ECU to the external test tool (upload).

The Request Download service is used by the external test tool to initiate a data transfer from the external test tool to the ECU (download).

The Transfer Data service is used by the external test tool to transfer data either from the external test tool to the ECU (download) or from the ECU to the external test tool (upload).

This service is used by the external test tool to terminate a data transfer between the external test tool and ECU (Upload or Download).&lt;/DESC&gt;
