          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;This session type provides a timer controlled environment for an ECU in which all of the supported diagnostic services can be executed. Those diagnostic services which temporarily alter the default behavior of an ECU are reset when the Extended Diagnostic Session is left (either by diagnostic service request or via a timeout condition). As all diagnostic services are supported in the Extended Diagnostic Session (given that security access protected diagnostic services are properly unlocked before usage) this session is usually entered before any diagnostics are performed in engineering, manufacturing and service.&lt;/DESC&gt;
