        &lt;SUBSERVICE qualifier="Soft" id="0x187cbdf4" active="true" actQual="EcuReset"&gt;
          &lt;CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
            &lt;CFGVARIANTREF ref="0x18717c84"/&gt;
          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;This type identifies a &amp;quot;soft reset&amp;quot; condition, which causes the ECU to immediately restart the application program if applicable.
Before restarting the application the ECU saves any data in non-volatile memory that might be lost during the startup sequence.&lt;/DESC&gt;
